        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona, basi, mnaifanya migumu mioyo yenu, kama vile wale Wamisri, naye yule Farao, walivyoifanya migumu mioyo yao? Hata na hao, hapo alipokwisha kuwadhihaki, je! Hawakuwaruhusu watu, nao wakaenda zao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
