                  "text": "Hes 19:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sasa jifanyizieni gari jipya, mtwae na ng’ombe wake wawili wakamwao, ambao hawajafungwa nira, nanyi mkawafunge hao ng’ombe garini, na kuwaondoa ndama zao na kuwatia zizini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kisha, litwaeni hilo sanduku la BWANA, na kuliweka juu ya gari; na hivyo vitu vya dhahabu, mtakavyompelekea kuwa matoleo ya kosa, mvitie katika kasha kando yake; mkalipeleke sanduku, lipate kwenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
